---
// Before/after: data on each machine vs storage (S3) separate from compute (query machines).
// Idea from the Snowflake SIGMOD 2016 paper, as summarised in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 300;
const left = [25, 155, 285];
const right = [490, 590, 690];
---
<figure class="tosc">
  <div class="tosc-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: each query machine keeps its own data on its own disk, so adding or losing a machine forces data to be reshuffled. Right: the data sits in S3 and query machines only cache what they need on local SSD, so machines can be added or removed with no data moving.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="tosc-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Data lives on each machine</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dữ liệu nằm trên từng máy</tspan></text>
    {left.map((x, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={x} y="56" width="120" height="116" rx="8" class="tosc-box" />
        <DiagramIcon name="server" x={x + 60} y={86} size={30} />
        <text x={x + 60} y="126" text-anchor="middle" class="tosc-name"><tspan data-lang-en>Machine {i + 1}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Máy {i + 1}</tspan></text>
        <text x={x + 60} y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="tosc-small"><tspan data-lang-en>own data</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dữ liệu riêng</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={44} y={216} size={24} />
    <text x="68" y="214" class="tosc-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>Add or lose a machine:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thêm hoặc mất một máy:</tspan></text>
    <text x="68" y="232" class="tosc-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>data must be reshuffled</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dữ liệu phải xáo lại</tspan></text>

    <line x1="450" x2="450" y1="20" y2="280" class="tosc-rule" />

    <text x="470" y="28" class="tosc-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Data in storage, machines only compute</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dữ liệu ở kho riêng, máy chỉ tính toán</tspan></text>
    <rect x="490" y="48" width="390" height="46" rx="8" class="tosc-store" />
    <DiagramIcon name="s3" x={520} y={71} size={28} />
    <text x="548" y="76" class="tosc-name"><tspan data-lang-en>All the data in S3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Toàn bộ dữ liệu trong S3</tspan></text>
    {right.map((x, i) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={x + 44} x2={x + 44} y1="94" y2="126" class="tosc-link" />
        <rect x={x} y="126" width="88" height="86" rx="8" class="tosc-box" />
        <DiagramIcon name="server" x={x + 44} y={152} size={26} />
        <text x={x + 44} y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="tosc-small">SSD cache</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1="834" x2="834" y1="94" y2="126" class="tosc-link is-new" />
    <rect x="790" y="126" width="88" height="86" rx="8" class="tosc-new" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={834} y={152} size={26} />
    <text x="834" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="tosc-good"><tspan data-lang-en>added</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mới thêm</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={494} y={246} size={24} />
    <text x="518" y="244" class="tosc-good"><tspan data-lang-en>Add machines for a big query, remove them after:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thêm máy cho query lớn, xong thì bỏ đi:</tspan></text>
    <text x="518" y="262" class="tosc-good"><tspan data-lang-en>no data moves</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không có dữ liệu nào phải chuyển</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Separation of storage and compute: the data stays put, so the machines that read it become easy to add and remove.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tách lưu trữ và tính toán: dữ liệu đứng yên, nên các máy đọc nó dễ thêm bớt.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tosc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .tosc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .tosc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .tosc text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .tosc .tosc-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .tosc .tosc-name { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .tosc .tosc-small { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tosc .tosc-bad { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .tosc .tosc-good { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .tosc-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .tosc-store { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .tosc-new { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .tosc-link { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .tosc-link.is-new { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .tosc-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .tosc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
